					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Veneranda Bryennios&lt;/color&gt;, a sickly child, is calling from nearby. She has deserted the army of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; and is being hunted by (*Threat)a loyalty squad(/Threat). She wishes to join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bryennios&lt;/color&gt; knows the location of key outpost containing everything needed to develop psychic powers:

  - Psylink neuroformer
  - Psylink neuroformer

Beware - If you accept &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bryennios&lt;/color&gt;, you will become an enemy of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt;! The pursuing loyalty squad will attack immediately. It is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 trooper&lt;/color&gt;

Only accept if you wish to fight against &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; and develop your psycasters on your own. You will have one year to attack the outpost before it is moved.</description>
