					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>A desperate refugee named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; is approaching. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; claims to have lost his home in a recent attack. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Steroid&lt;/color&gt; begs you for permission to stay at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;7 days&lt;/color&gt; so he can rest and regroup.

In return, he offers to work and fight for free during that time.

If you make him happy, he may offer to join you. He may also reward you later for helping him - but there is no way to know his true intentions.

This refugee is not part of any faction. If you wish, you can choose to kill, arrest, sell, or harvest him, without diplomatic consequences.</description>
