							<enableTick>11223000</enableTick>
							<descriptionPart>First, you need to find the &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;. Watch for opportunities to gather information about it.</descriptionPart>
							<resolvedDescriptionPart>First, you need to find the &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;Axe of Promises&lt;/color&gt;. Watch for opportunities to gather information about it.</resolvedDescriptionPart>
						</li>
