					<description>You've detected a farming work site nearby controlled by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Red Falcon Bobo&lt;/color&gt;.

If you wish, you can raid the camp to collect loot (chocolate x526). Since &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Red Falcon Bobo&lt;/color&gt; is just a small, independent group, you can attack them without any broader diplomatic consequences.

The camp will pack up and move on in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;30 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
