					<cleanupTick>11479105</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>3</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Theodos Glabas&lt;/color&gt;, an acolyte of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt;, recently lost a scouting party to a pack of (*Threat)79 manhunting fennec foxes(/Threat). He wants to draw the beasts towards you to be killed, to uphold his honor.The fennec foxes will arrive at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2 hours&lt;/color&gt; after you accept.</description>
