					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Freda 'Bunny' Yee&lt;/color&gt;, Ethical Chair of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Erera&lt;/color&gt;, wants you to help save one of her caravans. The caravan is being hunted near &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; by (*Threat)two groups of tribespeople(/Threat) from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Cheda Coalition&lt;/color&gt;. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bunny&lt;/color&gt; wants you to signal the tribespeople to draw them away from the caravan - and towards you.

The first group of tribespeople is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;4 archers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 berserker chief&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;5 berserkers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;8 heavy archers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;8 hunters&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 penitent&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;3 warriors&lt;/color&gt;

The second similar-sized group will follow soon after.

2 mercenary snipers will be placed under your control. You will have to feed and house them, but they may die in battle without consequence.

If you accept, the tribespeople will arrive in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;11 hours&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
