The monument is 19 x 27 in size and will require these resources (total value $3240):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x1010
  - Any of: Stony x1250
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x1340
    - Granite blocks x1340
    - Limestone blocks x1340
    - Slate blocks x1340
    - Marble blocks x1340

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;42 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;58 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the countess's enforcement system will activate and a pack of (*Threat)52 manhunting labrador retrievers(/Threat) will arrive.

