					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Gray Squirrel&lt;/color&gt;, Root Chief of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Cagalbra Pact&lt;/color&gt;, wants you to help save one of his caravans. The caravan is being hunted near &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; by (*Threat) pirates(/Threat) from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Burning Unit&lt;/color&gt;. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Squirrel&lt;/color&gt; wants you to signal the pirates to draw them away from the caravan - and towards you.

The group of pirates is composed of: 

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 boss&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;17 mercenary slashers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;4 scavenger thrashers&lt;/color&gt;

The pirates will arrive in transport pods.

If you accept, the pirates will arrive in &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;2 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
