				<li>
					<id>146</id>
					<name>Titanic Structure</name>
					<appearanceTick>23281000</appearanceTick>
					<ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>0</ticksUntilAcceptanceExpiry>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>23440141</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>Acolyte &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Keava Eurke&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Dominion&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to express how notorious he is.

The monument is 24 x 19 in size and will require these resources (total value $2191):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x1180
  - Any of: Stony x250
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x1004
    - Granite blocks x1004
    - Limestone blocks x1004
    - Slate blocks x1004
    - Marble blocks x1004

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;37 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;36 days&lt;/color&gt;. If any piece of it is destroyed, the acolyte's enforcement system will activate and a mech cluster will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Lados&lt;/color&gt; containing:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 centipede blasters&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 centipede burner&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 centipede gunner&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 militors&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 pikeman&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 scorchers&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 scyther&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 tesseron&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 toxic spewer&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;4 mech nodes&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech high-shield&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech assembler&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 mech drop beacon&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;5 auto inferno turrets&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;4 mini-slugger turrets&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 auto charge turret&lt;/color&gt;

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
					<root>BuildMonument_TimeProtect</root>
